@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title D05 - Small world DTAL cache state model
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName SansSerif

state "Empty" as Empty
state "Building temporary data" as Building
state "Ready" as Ready
Ready : Ordinary frames update parameters without topology rebuild
state "No compatible data / reported failure" as Failed

[*] --> Empty
Empty --> Building : regeneration at safe boundary
Ready --> Building : relevant invalidation
Failed --> Building : explicit or bounded retry
Building --> Ready : valid complete replacement installed
Building --> Ready : failure / obsolete request and old data compatible
Building --> Failed : failure and no compatible installed data
Ready --> Empty : map unload / reset
Failed --> Empty : map unload / reset
Empty --> [*] : cache teardown

note right of Building
  Installed data is not mutated while temporary data is built.
  A later request remains pending.
  No background generation service is required.
end note
note bottom of Ready
  Replaced native buffers and wrappers use existing RHI retirement.
  Older submitted frames keep valid resource lifetimes.
end note
@enduml
